8.</l><l xml:id="m-85dc0779-2096-4af5-8015-b2ed345be97f" facs="#m-51362176-08e1-4df5-89d4-059ffd505b7d" label="lyrics-like">At Prime. Ant. Natívitas gloriósae. D. 1625. In the Short Resp., the</l><l xml:id="m-a9e1b5dc-a399-4d95-b222-cad80b40786d" facs="#m-0775000b-f6cd-4511-9b8c-389f46127b6b" label="lyrics-like">V. 1s Qui nátus es. p. 229. Short Lesson. In platéis. p. 1257.</l><l xml:id="m-a8214655-d0ee-461d-b5d7-431fa3a3b169" facs="#m-02d22576-f41c-469c-81f1-fdd3ffcce08a" label="text-like">At Terce. Hymn, p. 1256.</l><l xml:id="m-4c14b3d2-0e50-49d2-b8c9-7bd68f23dfd2" facs="#m-b136e249-22b2-4ba9-89c2-c495a3899f70" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Natívitas est hódie. p. 1625. Chapter. Ab inítio. p. 1259.</l><l xml:id="m-ef70cfc7-4d88-4acb-b7e3-dce5d591ae2c" facs="#m-30b8c283-70ef-4dbd-981c-5768c91f7fbb" label="lyrics-like">short Resp. Spécie túa. p. 1256. v. Adjuvábit éam.</l><l xml:id="m-fb7a4ed8-5834-448e-8c9b-a04775d30cc4" facs="#m-a8e9f898-ea03-4960-986e-6aa916adefee" label="text-like">AT MASS.</l><l xml:id="m-2f1c15f8-2f00-4c8b-b6cc-b816d805ef74" facs="#m-b4ee41d0-923f-4e85-abcb-fd03fa6b88ed" label="lyrics-like">Introit. Sálve sáncta párens. p. 1263.</l><l xml:id="m-771ad125-69b9-4ff6-833a-58e9d4828eff" facs="#m-ff00a2f0-bd3c-48b3-abba-6f9051ed8231" label="ambiguous">Collect</l><l xml:id="m-f1e5fe4a-4ae4-4a77-b5ee-100a4abb6e83" facs="#m-396d8d66-f32b-4e69-93de-10cb57cdba43" label="lyrics-like">L'Amulis tuis, quaésumus Dómine, ]Nativitátis ejus votiva solémnita¬</l><l xml:id="m-23fb7d0c-e490-49d5-bad3-6c3a81d61ddc" facs="#m-284321ce-2be1-446f-827c-7d310de3e2d6" label="lyrics-like">Fcaeléstis grátiae munus imper-] pacis tribuat increméntum. Per Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-928ae71b-9dea-40ff-9cfd-2d5ace6de15d" facs="#m-03830680-4bf3-435c-9e83-dbd2d4496fc6" label="lyrics-like">tire: fut quibus beátae Virginis ] minum.</l><l xml:id="m-22c1beb9-8190-4162-a285-552c84861ef4" facs="#m-0d735da2-5881-42d7-984d-d81c129581d9" label="lyrics-like">partus exstitit salútis exórdium,</l><l xml:id="m-c2c388e6-dbdc-48bf-982d-aba96d9b2a66" facs="#m-2b5eb7d8-1207-4254-ae5f-e1674f9b5841" label="lyrics-like">Epistie. Dóminus possédit me. p. 1317.</l><l xml:id="m-55ca1705-891f-490d-8060-7db975aeaf12" facs="#m-42c67d93-26be-44e5-aea5-5d4eef479b67" label="lyrics-like">Gradual. Benedicta et venerábilis. D. 1264. Alleluia, allelúia. V. Félix</l><l xml:id="m-88ad3363-15ad-4963-864a-ef4726fda181" facs="#m-283c822b-db60-415b-807f-b4ae86d0cf55" label="ambiguous">es. p. 1539.</l><l xml:id="m-28afb5c7-fe54-455f-820e-b917780feb47" facs="#m-d02aa82e-8955-43f8-9b99-90290168c43e" label="ambiguous">* Initium sancti Evangelli secundum Matthaeum. Matth. I.</l><l xml:id="m-195b2953-9577-41e4-9202-242d6e28ca25" facs="#m-e7889195-aaeb-481f-90e2-1a374236537b" label="lyrics-like">Iber generatiónis Jesu Christi! tem génuit Salmon. Salmon autem</l><l xml:id="m-abf348f6-2f04-4443-ae56-651e2ec5ec73" facs="#m-ab6d401d-c97f-4518-84e8-0106b756c8fc" label="ambiguous">A fili David, fili Abraham. Abra¬</l><l xml:id="m-cae1206c-6fed-4dac-842f-56d3d6f1e7a9" facs="#m-2841bf4a-14ef-4e44-92a7-e73eec8f7438" label="lyrics-like">génuit Booz de Rahab. Booz autem</l><l xml:id="m-9b4d2263-b57b-4ea6-9170-d424753461cc" facs="#m-b534fd17-af98-4dd9-b32a-a034ba1ba68e" label="lyrics-like">ham génuit Isaac. Isaac autem gé¬</l><l xml:id="m-963a8a61-d056-4cab-bea1-35235e5fbd66" facs="#m-d0e7da24-c8ed-4f4e-aa39-4560d9278f80" label="lyrics-like">génuit Obed ex Ruth. Obed autem</l><l xml:id="m-de5af88a-160f-4d16-8143-28dc4f7f63d5" facs="#m-c75ec50f-fc66-4cc6-bc9c-7b01b752765b" label="lyrics-like">génuit Jesse. Jesse autem génuit</l><l xml:id="m-cdb38e19-068f-4e91-90a1-97a01f1cf750" facs="#m-4cecced1-9a8c-41ca-a8d1-728d10d7f480" label="lyrics-like">nuit Jacob. Jacob autem génuit</l><l xml:id="m-dc6b36fd-8abc-431c-ae43-9b75f8101e78" facs="#m-9ac20243-8095-4c70-a36b-786049385515" label="ambiguous">David regem. David autem rex</l><l xml:id="m-124322f6-3689-48c4-826f-cc5c29ade06b" facs="#m-bf500b0d-2a90-4892-9886-322072ac7a9c" label="ambiguous">Judam et fratres ejus. Judas autem</l><l xml:id="m-38571176-6525-48d6-8aa5-55208fc6c68a" facs="#m-e57f0559-69c7-491b-9a57-7e18f69895d0" label="lyrics-like">génuit Phares et Zaram de Thamar.</l><l xml:id="m-c77a6cfb-eb2b-478c-8055-83a7fc6599aa" facs="#m-ce78b296-fb27-4157-8ac2-f064a5cb84b7" label="lyrics-like">génuit Salomónem ex ea quae fuit</l><l xml:id="m-b7350395-3061-4cf6-9521-dcda1dca0b90" facs="#m-be8f9f4c-a990-4e06-b481-d292ee478e16" label="lyrics-like">Phares autem génuit Esron. Esron</l><l xml:id="m-7f3f5a5d-ee88-4b75-9f40-653bb3bd75e3" facs="#m-03ddc5e2-c66d-439b-8558-5dd910f1b4cc" label="lyrics-like">Uriae. Sálomon autem génuit Ró¬</l><l xml:id="m-192032b1-b7f2-40b3-a638-e21ece3817aa" facs="#m-9c6d64ce-d283-4e50-9e46-b43972aa1b79" label="lyrics-like">autem génuit Aram. Aram autem</l><l xml:id="m-8a3c20fb-eabd-4c99-bfe5-5fd0a24500a0" facs="#m-6f3dcf3d-a8bc-4d4f-a3a2-ca310a4a0e2f" label="lyrics-like">boam. Róboam autem génuit Abiam.</l><l xml:id="m-b8d3e6cf-ae68-478f-918c-2e5139e3f894" facs="#m-d16b9fe9-e96c-4765-9580-e62f57f13296" label="lyrics-like">génuit Amínadab. Aminadab au¬</l><l xml:id="m-f7b909d5-e363-4194-818f-1e745f130d0d" facs="#m-e5edd752-526b-4430-ae4d-d06912ae4cee" label="lyrics-like">Abías autem génuit Asa. Asa au¬</l><l xml:id="m-d06344d6-a139-4fe0-921b-3325d596bd70" facs="#m-7091c047-3304-4ce3-bbd4-cf82a3a214a4" label="lyrics-like">tem génuit Naásson. Naásson au-ltem génuit Jósaphat. Jósaphat au¬</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
